Simon Tatham's Portable Puzzle Collection
=========================================

vendor/sgtpuzzles/ is a verbatim copy of the upstream working tree, with the
.git directory removed. No local modifications have been made to it.

    repository  https://git.tartarus.org/simon/puzzles.git
    commit      3c3632259d298ab62aafa8a5858823569ab1af46
    date        2026-07-19
    subject     Click-and-type puzzles: clicks outside grid hide cursor
    licence     MIT (see vendor/sgtpuzzles/LICENCE)

To refresh:

    git clone https://git.tartarus.org/simon/puzzles.git /tmp/sgtpuzzles
    rm -rf vendor/sgtpuzzles && cp -r /tmp/sgtpuzzles vendor/sgtpuzzles
    rm -rf vendor/sgtpuzzles/.git
    ./scripts/build-games.sh

Then update the commit details above and commit both the source and the
regenerated public/games and public/doc output together.
